<!--
    Samsung Remote - monochrome layer for Android 13+ themed icons.

    The system keeps only the alpha channel and re-tints it, so this is a single flat
    silhouette of the remote with its controls knocked out as real holes (evenOdd fill):
    a power dot, the navigation ring with its centre, and a key bar.

    Same geometry as the full-colour foreground, so the two read as one icon:
        body x 36..72, y 23..85; power at (54,35.5); wheel at (54,60); keys at y 76.5..80.5.
-->
